 "headline": "Derrick White Is Flipping BrookynDynasty's Lead",
 "notes": [
  "BrookynDynasty just stole FG% and OREB from LeParth James, and it still leads 6-5 with Derrick White and Onyeka Okongwu cooking on the other side.",
  "Jayson Tatum has 26 points, 8 assists and five threes on 8-14 shooting, and theInfamous is leading Thug Life 6-4 because of it.",
  "Norman Powell dropped 18 points with two steals on Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw's bench, leaving DREB on the table in a 6-5 game.",
  "Zero Fox Given's Myles Turner is 0-2 and CJ McCollum is 1-7, and the team still leads MONSTARS 6-5. Somebody get that lead checked.",
  "Gopher Gold has nine players with a stat line and the worst night in the league. Aday Mara has two points, so the depth is mostly decorative."
 ],
